.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=Version Info

@Contents
$^#Version info#

    This plugin module is intended to view information about
version of file which is selected on the panel. The plugin works only in
Far 1.70 build 1634 and above. It does not allow to save information to a file, but
you may use ~Dir2File.srp~@<..\Dir2File\>Contents@ or #clipboard# for this purpose.

    If you will enter new filename in the dialog and will press #OK#, program
will show the information about typed filename.
